---
import BaseLayout from '@layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PortfolioMap from '@components/PortfolioMap';
---

<BaseLayout title="Conner Myers">
  <div class="home-page design-c">
    <div class="design-c__canopy" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="design-c__trail" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <div class="design-c__shell">
      <!-- Trailhead hero -->
      <header class="design-c__hero">
        <div class="design-c__badge">Trailhead</div>
        <div class="design-c__hero-grid">
          <div class="design-c__hero-copy">
            <h1 class="design-c__name">Conner Myers</h1>
            <p class="design-c__tagline">Explorer · Developer · Grower</p>
            <div class="design-c__intro">
              <p>Hi, I'm Conner. I graduated in May 2026 at the age of 30 with a B.S. in computer science/cybersecurity from Liberty University. The timeline of my life is rather nonlinear and looks pretty neat on a map, feel free to check it out in the map space below. Massive credit to my mom for taking pictures throughout the years and organizing them.</p>
              <p>Whether you're a friend, family member, or stranger on the internet, I hope this page helps us connect a little closer. If you want to get in touch, please don't hesitate to send me an email at <a href="mailto:conn0myers@gmail.com">conn0myers@gmail.com</a>.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="design-c__portrait portrait-anchor">
            <div class="design-c__portrait-frame">
              <img src="/images/Me.jpg" alt="Conner Myers" width="150" height="150" />
            </div>
            <span class="design-c__portrait-caption">Mile 0</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </header>

      <!-- Map as trail map -->
      <section class="design-c__map-section home-map-row" aria-label="Life map">
        <div class="design-c__map-label">
          <span class="design-c__map-icon">🗺</span>
          <span>Your journey starts here — explore the map</span>
        </div>
        <div class="design-c__map-frame map-panel">
          <div class="map-panel__inner">
            <PortfolioMap client:only="react" />
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <main class="design-c__main home-main">
        <div class="home-main__content">

          <section class="design-c__waypoint">
            <div class="design-c__waypoint-marker" aria-hidden="true">
              <span class="design-c__marker-dot"></span>
              <span class="design-c__marker-line"></span>
            </div>
            <div class="design-c__waypoint-body">
              <h2 class="design-c__section-title">Work Experience</h2>
              <p class="design-c__text">In 2017 I enlisted in the United States Air Force, following in the footsteps of my dad. During my four year term I traveled to California, Colorado and New Mexico to work on military satellite communications (MILSATCOM). I was told that for national security resons I wasn't allowed to take pictures of what I did, but you can see my full work history on LinkedIn by clicking on the card below.</p>
              <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/conner-myers-0411481b1/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="design-c__card waypoint-card" style="--card-bg: url('/images/cards/usaf.jpg')">
                <span class="design-c__card-ribbon">USAF / MILSATCOM · 2017 – 2021</span>
                <span class="design-c__card-link">See full work history on LinkedIn →</span>
              </a>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="design-c__waypoint">
            <div class="design-c__waypoint-marker" aria-hidden="true">
              <span class="design-c__marker-dot"></span>
              <span class="design-c__marker-line"></span>
            </div>
            <div class="design-c__waypoint-body">
              <h2 class="design-c__section-title">Projects</h2>
              <p class="design-c__text">In university I got curious about game development so I took a free course online for Unity. You can check out two prototype games I built below, just curb your expectations.</p>
              <div class="design-c__card design-c__card--unity waypoint-card" style="--card-bg: url('/images/cards/Unity.webp')">
                <span class="design-c__card-ribbon">Unity Game Dev Course</span>
                <div class="design-c__unity-pair">
                  <a href="https://piancavallo.itch.io/unity-vehicle-demo" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="design-c__unity-card" style="--card-bg: url('/images/Unity Tank driving thumbnail.jpg')">
                    <span class="design-c__unity-title">Tank Driver's Ed</span>
                    <span class="design-c__unity-cta">Play game →</span>
                  </a>
                  <a href="https://piancavallo.itch.io/soccer" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="design-c__unity-card" style="--card-bg: url('/images/Soccer.jpg')">
                    <span class="design-c__unity-title">Soccer</span>
                    <span class="design-c__unity-cta">Play game →</span>
                  </a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="design-c__waypoint">
            <div class="design-c__waypoint-marker" aria-hidden="true">
              <span class="design-c__marker-dot"></span>
              <span class="design-c__marker-line"></span>
            </div>
            <div class="design-c__waypoint-body">
              <h2 class="design-c__section-title">Hobbies</h2>
              <p class="design-c__text">In the summer and fall of 2023 I lived (in a barn) and worked on an organic farm in north-western Arkansas. I've since found great joy in growing my own food at home.</p>
              <div class="design-c__card-row">
                <a href="/media?tab=garden" class="design-c__card waypoint-card" style="--card-bg: url('/images/cards/garden.jpg')">
                  <span class="design-c__card-ribbon">Backyard Garden</span>
                  <span class="design-c__card-link">View garden →</span>
                </a>
                <a href="/media?tab=books" class="design-c__card waypoint-card" style="--card-bg: url('/images/cards/library.webp')">
                  <span class="design-c__card-ribbon">Library</span>
                  <span class="design-c__card-link">Browse library →</span>
                </a>
              </div>
              <p class="design-c__text design-c__text--note">I'm keeping a digital libary of the books I've been reading.</p>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="design-c__waypoint design-c__waypoint--last">
            <div class="design-c__waypoint-marker" aria-hidden="true">
              <span class="design-c__marker-dot design-c__marker-dot--end"></span>
            </div>
            <div class="design-c__waypoint-body">
              <h2 class="design-c__section-title">Contact</h2>
              <p class="design-c__text design-c__text--note">Send a signal from base camp.</p>
              <div class="design-c__contact contact-stamps" aria-label="Contact links">
                <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/conner-myers-0411481b1/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="design-c__chip design-c__chip--moss">LinkedIn</a>
                <button id="email-copy-button" type="button" data-email="conn0myers@gmail.com" class="design-c__chip design-c__chip--bark">
                  <span class="stamp-button__default">Email</span>
                  <span class="stamp-button__copied" aria-hidden="true">Copied!</span>
                </button>
                <a href="/Conner_Myers_Resume.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="design-c__chip design-c__chip--clay" title="Open resume (PDF)">Resume</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </section>
        </div>
      </main>

      <footer class="design-c__footer">
        <span>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Conner Myers</span>
        <span class="design-c__footer-dot">·</span>
        <span>Crafted with <a href="https://astro.build/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Astro</a> under open sky</span>
      </footer>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    const emailButton = document.getElementById('email-copy-button');
    let copyFeedbackTimeout: ReturnType<typeof setTimeout> | null = null;
    emailButton?.addEventListener('click', async () => {
      const email = emailButton.dataset.email;
      if (!email) return;
      await navigator.clipboard.writeText(email);
      emailButton.classList.add('is-copied');
      if (copyFeedbackTimeout) clearTimeout(copyFeedbackTimeout);
      copyFeedbackTimeout = setTimeout(() => emailButton.classList.remove('is-copied'), 1250);
    });
  </script>

  <style is:global>
    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,500;9..144,700&family=Nunito:wght@400;600;700&display=swap');

    html, body {
      background: #e8e0d0 !important;
      background-image:
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 20% 0%, rgba(74, 124, 89, 0.12) 0%, transparent 50%),
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 80% 100%, rgba(139, 90, 43, 0.1) 0%, transparent 45%),
        linear-gradient(175deg, #ebe4d4 0%, #ddd4c0 40%, #d4cbb5 100%) !important;
      color: #2c3e2a !important;
      font-family: 'Nunito', 'Segoe UI', sans-serif !important;
    }
    h1, h2, h3, h4 {
      font-family: 'Fraunces', Georgia, serif !important;
      color: #1e3d24 !important;
      letter-spacing: 0.01em !important;
    }
  </style>

  <style>
    .design-c {
      position: relative;
      min-height: 100svh;
      color: #2c3e2a;
    }

    .design-c__canopy {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse 120% 40% at 50% -10%, rgba(45, 90, 55, 0.18) 0%, transparent 60%),
        radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 30% at 10% 20%, rgba(74, 124, 89, 0.08) 0%, transparent 50%),
        radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 25% at 90% 15%, rgba(74, 124, 89, 0.06) 0%, transparent 45%);
    }

    .design-c__trail {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      opacity: 0.04;
      background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg width='60' height='60' viewBox='0 0 60 60' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cpath d='M30 5 Q35 20 30 35 Q25 50 30 55' stroke='%232c5a32' fill='none' stroke-width='1.5'/%3E%3C/svg%3E");
      background-size: 80px 80px;
    }

    .design-c__shell {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 2.5rem 1.25rem 2rem;
    }

    .design-c__hero {
      position: relative;
      margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
      padding: 2rem 1.75rem;
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(255, 252, 245, 0.92) 0%, rgba(245, 238, 220, 0.88) 100%);
      border-radius: 24px 24px 24px 8px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(74, 103, 65, 0.2);
      box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(44, 62, 42, 0.08);
    }

    .design-c__badge {
      position: absolute;
      top: -0.6rem;
      left: 1.5rem;
      padding: 0.25rem 0.85rem;
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: #f5f0e6;
      background: #3d6b47;
      border-radius: 100px;
    }

    .design-c__hero-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
      gap: 2rem;
      align-items: start;
      margin-top: 0.5rem;
    }

    @media (max-width: 680px) {
      .design-c__hero-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .design-c__portrait { justify-self: center; }
    }

    .design-c__name {
      margin: 0 0 0.25rem;
      font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 5vw, 3.25rem);
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 1.1;
      color: #1e3d24;
    }

    .design-c__tagline {
      margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #5a7a52;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    }

    .design-c__intro p {
      margin: 0 0 0.85rem;
      font-size: 1rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: #3d4f3a;
    }

    .design-c__intro a {
      color: #2d5a3d;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-decoration: underline;
      text-underline-offset: 3px;
      text-decoration-color: rgba(45, 90, 61, 0.4);
    }

    .design-c__intro a:hover { color: #8b5a2b; }

    .design-c__portrait-frame {
      padding: 6px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, #6b8f5e 0%, #4a6741 50%, #8b5a2b 100%);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(44, 62, 42, 0.15);
    }

    .design-c__portrait-frame img {
      display: block;
      width: 9.375rem;
      height: 9.375rem;
      border-radius: 50%;
      object-fit: cover;
      border: 3px solid #f5f0e6;
    }

    .design-c__portrait-caption {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 0.5rem;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: #8b5a2b;
    }

    .design-c__map-section { margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }

    .design-c__map-label {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #4a6741;
    }

    .design-c__map-frame {
      border-radius: 16px;
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 3px solid #c4b89a;
      background: #f5f0e6;
      box-shadow:
        0 8px 30px rgba(44, 62, 42, 0.1),
        inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
    }

    .design-c__waypoint {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 2rem 1fr;
      gap: 0 1.25rem;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .design-c__waypoint-marker {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      padding-top: 0.35rem;
    }

    .design-c__marker-dot {
      width: 14px;
      height: 14px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #4a7c59;
      border: 3px solid #f5f0e6;
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px #4a7c59;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .design-c__marker-dot--end {
      background: #8b5a2b;
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px #8b5a2b;
    }

    .design-c__marker-line {
      flex: 1;
      width: 3px;
      min-height: 2rem;
      margin-top: 4px;
      background: repeating-linear-gradient(
        180deg,
        #a8b89a 0 6px,
        transparent 6px 12px
      );
      border-radius: 2px;
    }

    .design-c__section-title {
      margin: 0 0 0.6rem;
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #1e3d24;
    }

    .design-c__text {
      margin: 0 0 1rem;
      font-size: 0.975rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: #3d4f3a;
      max-width: 40rem;
    }

    .design-c__text--note {
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      color: #5a6b52;
      font-style: italic;
    }

    .design-c__card-row {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
      gap: 1rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .design-c__card {
      position: relative;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: flex-end;
      min-height: 200px;
      padding: 1rem;
      border-radius: 14px;
      overflow: hidden;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: #fff;
      background: var(--card-bg) center / cover no-repeat;
      background-color: #4a6741;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(44, 62, 42, 0.12);
      transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
    }

    .design-c__card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(44, 62, 42, 0.18);
    }

    .design-c__card::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(30, 45, 28, 0.7) 0%, rgba(30, 45, 28, 0.1) 55%);
      border-radius: 14px;
    }

    .design-c__card > * { position: relative; z-index: 1; }

    .design-c__card-ribbon {
      position: absolute;
      top: 0.85rem;
      left: 0.85rem;
      z-index: 2;
      padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #1e3d24;
      background: rgba(245, 240, 230, 0.93);
      border-radius: 8px;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    }

    .design-c__card-link {
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .design-c__card--unity {
      cursor: default;
      padding: 0;
      min-height: auto;
    }

    .design-c__unity-pair {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      min-height: 200px;
    }

    .design-c__unity-card {
      position: relative;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: flex-end;
      padding: 0.85rem;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: #fff;
      background: var(--card-bg) center / cover no-repeat;
      transition: filter 0.25s ease;
    }

    .design-c__unity-card::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background: rgba(30, 45, 28, 0.35);
      transition: background 0.25s ease;
    }

    .design-c__unity-card:hover::after { background: rgba(30, 45, 28, 0.15); }
    .design-c__unity-card > * { position: relative; z-index: 1; }

    .design-c__unity-title {
      position: absolute;
      top: 0.65rem;
      left: 0.65rem;
      padding: 0.3rem 0.6rem;
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #1e3d24;
      background: rgba(245, 240, 230, 0.92);
      border-radius: 6px;
    }

    .design-c__unity-cta {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .design-c__contact {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.65rem;
    }

    .design-c__chip {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 0.6rem 1.15rem;
      font-family: inherit;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-decoration: none;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 100px;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
    }

    .design-c__chip:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(44, 62, 42, 0.15);
    }

    .design-c__chip--moss {
      color: #f5f0e6;
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, #5a8f62 0%, #3d6b47 100%);
    }

    .design-c__chip--bark {
      color: #f5f0e6;
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, #8b5a2b 0%, #6b4423 100%);
    }

    .design-c__chip--clay {
      color: #f5f0e6;
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, #a67c52 0%, #8b6340 100%);
    }

    .stamp-button__copied { display: none; }
    .design-c__chip.is-copied .stamp-button__default { display: none; }
    .design-c__chip.is-copied .stamp-button__copied { display: inline; }

    .design-c__footer {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 0.35rem 0.75rem;
      padding: 2rem 0 1rem;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: #6b7d62;
    }

    .design-c__footer a {
      color: #3d6b47;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .design-c__footer a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

    :global(body.map-expanded) .map-panel,
    :global(body.map-expanded) .map-panel__inner { overflow: visible; }
    :global(body.map-expanded) .home-map-row { position: relative; z-index: 100; }
    :global(body.map-expanded) .design-c__main,
    :global(body.map-expanded) .design-c__footer,
    :global(body.map-expanded) .design-c__hero { visibility: hidden; pointer-events: none; }
    :global(body.map-expanded) .design-c__contact { display: none; }
    :global(body.map-expanded) .portrait-anchor { display: none; }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
